From 617187a9034e3bf6df4f069ed5d7dd3bb07595d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dashing Man <259168171+Tejas7787@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 21:04:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vercel build: commit Convex generated types

The .gitignore excluded src/convex/_generated/, so Vercel's fresh
checkout lacked the generated server/dataModel/api types that
Convex backend files import. This caused TS2307 "Cannot find module
'./_generated/server'" and cascading implicit-any errors.

Fix: remove _generated from .gitignore and commit the generated
files. Convex docs state these should be committed to the repo.

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
---
 .gitignore                           |   2 +-
 src/convex/_generated/api.d.ts       |  65 +++++++++++
 src/convex/_generated/api.js         |  23 ++++
 src/convex/_generated/dataModel.d.ts |  60 ++++++++++
 src/convex/_generated/server.d.ts    | 162 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/convex/_generated/server.js      | 101 +++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 412 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 src/convex/_generated/api.d.ts
 create mode 100644 src/convex/_generated/api.js
 create mode 100644 src/convex/_generated/dataModel.d.ts
 create mode 100644 src/convex/_generated/server.d.ts
 create mode 100644 src/convex/_generated/server.js

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index ce1b39f..ea613df 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 .env.local
